        "zh": {
          "title": "Embraer 公佈荷蘭產業合作進度 籌備 C-390 運輸機隊支援",
          "summary": "Embraer 在鹿特丹公佈荷蘭合作案進度，包括為 C-390 建立在地維修與後勤能力。",
          "body": [
            "Embraer 於11月19日在荷蘭鹿特丹的 NEDS 展會公佈產業合作進度。公司表示，已與荷蘭軍事生產主管機關及當地企業、研究機構推動多項合作，並正為荷蘭 C-390 運輸機隊的長期運作做準備。",
            "C-390 支援準備涵蓋培養在地維修、整合後勤、構型管理與訓練能力。Embraer 表示，另有合作專案著眼於改善飛機維修作業與可用性。",
            "荷蘭方面指出，相關合作建立在採購 C-390 的產業參與安排上。這次公告說明合作與機隊支援準備的進度，未公佈新的採購數量或交付日期。"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "Embraer reports Dutch industrial cooperation progress and C-390 support preparations",
          "summary": "The manufacturer is developing local maintenance, logistics and training capabilities for the Dutch C-390 fleet.",
          "body": [
            "Embraer reported progress on its Dutch industrial participation programme at NEDS in Rotterdam on November 19. It said several projects with Dutch industry, research institutions and the country’s military production authority are under way.",
            "Preparations for the long-term operation of the Dutch C-390 Millennium fleet include developing local expertise in maintenance, integrated logistics, configuration management and training. Other projects focus on improving aircraft maintenance and availability.",
            "The Dutch military production commissioner linked the collaboration to the C-390 acquisition. The announcement outlined industrial cooperation and support preparations, without giving a new procurement quantity or delivery date."
          ]
        },
